      "value": "After some consideration, this is probably because we no longer have a distinction between \"female\" and \"male\" animation sets. The default animations for AV3 are the \"Male\" set from before, although the \"female\" animation set is at least partially available.\nTry dropping in the vrc_AvatarV3HandsLayer2 animation set and see if you prefer those.",
